{"4385220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "life: Start To Return", "steam_appid": 4385220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>=== Live an ordinary life as a junior game programmer! ===</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>~ A</i> <i>1st Person Bottleneck Style Visual Novel ~</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the bustling <strong><i>Paracoast City</i></strong> through a span of <strong>4 In-Game Weeks</strong> and overcome various everyday ordeals such as <strong>going to work</strong>, <strong>paying rent</strong>, and <strong>making time for yourself on your free time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385220/extras/b6052537700e43efbee32e881518a3ca.avif?t=1773086394\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, make meaningful connections with those called <strong><i>Achates Bonds</i></strong>. These are relationships forged from shared moments that promises to give insight on different characters within and out of the Main Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385220/extras/d0361c54c54c631a07917931d59ca889.avif?t=1773086394\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>=== Key Features ===</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Different Endings</strong> - Experience the linear <strong>Main Story</strong> and how you live life will impact the outcome of the ending!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After Bonds Post Game</strong> - Meet the conditions to unlock a new story that focuses on some of the characters in the game, adding<strong> 3 More</strong> endings that can be achieved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Additional Side Plots</strong> - Each of the 10<strong> Characters</strong> include their own <strong>Unique Plotlines</strong> and <strong>7</strong> can be optionally <strong>Dated!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point &amp; Click Gameplay - 13 Explorable Areas </strong>and <strong>14 Different Programming Scenarios.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>33 In-Game Days</strong> - Explore to your hearts content throughout this duration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-6 Hours of Gameplay</strong> - Approximately <strong>115,000 Words!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Original Music</strong> - More than<strong> 30</strong> Tracks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Start your life</i> and unfold the bizarre truths behind this so called, <i>'Ordinary Life.'</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>=== Live an ordinary life as a junior game programmer! ===</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>~ A</i> <i>1st Person Bottleneck Style Visual Novel ~</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the bustling <strong><i>Paracoast City</i></strong> through a span of <strong>4 In-Game Weeks</strong> and overcome various everyday ordeals such as <strong>going to work</strong>, <strong>paying rent</strong>, and <strong>making time for yourself on your free time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\